{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgt9aKLCvhdLok6e1BFYR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The app is upgraded to Pollar 0.12.0 (the current npm release), and `npx tsc --noEmit` passes. The changes and the reasoning are in `ANSWER.md`.\n\nBoth silent changes from the colleague's note apply here:\n\n- **Pinned `baseUrl`:** `src/pollar.ts` had `.../v1`. In 0.12 the SDK appends `/v3` itself, so the old value would have requested `/v1/v3`. It is now the bare origin.\n- **Null balance:** `src/balances.ts` now shows `USDC unavailable` for a `null` balance. A real `'0'` still shows `USDC 0.00`.\n\nThe other changes:\n\n- **KYC (`src/kyc.ts`):** `'expired'` now returns \"Verification expired\".\n- **Trustline (`src/trust.ts`):** `setTrustline(USDC)` replaces the removed `sponsored` option. Who pays is now decided by the app's sponsorship setting, not per call.\n- **Ramp quote (`src/ramp.ts`):** `getRampsQuote` is replaced. The function looks up the AR/ARS USDC route with `getRampRoutes`, then calls `quoteRamp`. The rate is `amountIn / amountOut`, and it returns `null` when there is no route or no quote.\n\nI departed from the colleague's note in one place. It hard-codes the ramp `rail`, but the API takes one of several values and I couldn't confirm the right one for Argentina. The code takes the rail from the route the API returns.\n\nI checked the changed functions against stub clients. The quote gives 1250 for 10000 ARS in and 8 USDC out, and the null and expired cases behave as intended. I did not call the live API.\n\nThings to check before relying on this:\n\n- **Trustline sponsorship:** the app used to force sponsorship. If the dashboard setting does not sponsor trustlines, users will pay the reserve.\n- **Extra request:** \"Add money\" now makes two calls instead of one.\n- **Untracked files:** `node_modules/` is untracked and there is no `.gitignore`. ANSWER.md is also untracked. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":356,"cache_read_input_tokens":68928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":356},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"b0aa2e7a-ec07-4c51-b0b0-a33dc08a2abd","uuid":"12455867-2314-45c5-b1db-7f16da745171","timestamp":"2026-11-09T22:32:41.407Z","request_id":"req_011Cgt9aKB2xkxEw5jDoggJQ"}
